// Title: Google Workspace Role Modified or Deleted
// ID: 6aef64e3-60c6-4782-8db3-8448759c714e
// Status: test
// Level: medium
// Author: Austin Songer
// Date: 2021-08-24
// Tags: attack.impact
// Description: Detects when an a role is modified or deleted in Google Workspace.
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

any where (eventService == "admin.googleapis.com" and (eventName == "DELETE_ROLE" or eventName == "RENAME_ROLE" or eventName == "UPDATE_ROLE"))
